  "summary": "I’m a software engineer and technical leader with more than two decades of experience, including over 18 years dedicated to advancing healthcare technology. My career has centered on building large‑scale, distributed systems; designing API‑driven architectures; modernizing cloud platforms; and enabling interoperability across complex EHR ecosystems.\n\nFor over a decade, I’ve played a key role in shaping the Veradigm platforms and the Health and Hospital System EHR services - driving core architecture, strengthening foundational services, and partnering across engineering, product, security, and clinical teams to deliver solutions that enhance workflows and support better patient outcomes.\n\nI’m energized by solving complex technical challenges, mentoring engineers, and building scalable, resilient systems through thoughtful design, collaboration, and a commitment to engineering excellence.",
